{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“The sword. It made me realize I was not true of heart. My actions were benevolent my my intentions were selfish. If I was to truly prove myself worthy, I had to put away my greatest flaw: greed. I’ll admit. I’m obsessed with knowledge and money and power and perfection. I can’t be happy without it and it drives me insane sometimes. I needed to prove, not only to the sword, but to *myself* that I was *good* enough. I have come far, but not nearly far enough. Cato, I do not deserve to be wedded to you if I am filled with greed and power and lust for knowledge that is guarded for reasons larger than me. I needed to prove to myself that I am worthy to be loved the way you love me, and that when I put my life on the line for others, that I’m not doing it for a name, or for a legacy. I love you. I will protect myself, but you come first and I may be headstrong and still learning, but I will put you and the friends I love first any time. I will put the lives of strangers before my own if that means I can atone for the sins of my past and be better in the present. I love you, my darling Cato, and I wish I could make you wholly understand but that will take time.”","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:05:45.863000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737566453611495525","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"They bow their head, ready to receive what judgement they will get.","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:06:07.042000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-28T07:06:17.203000Z","id":"737566542442659840","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"It was suicide. You left me no choice but to put myself in danger as well despite how hurt I was. Jumping into it's mouth.\" He shakes his head. His paw is bleeding again. \"I can't keep losing more people.\" You can see the claws biting into his flesh. He begins to sob. \"The knights don't believe in blind selfish disregard in a way to arbitrarily get passed your flaws. It takes work, patience, and time. I knew what you were doing and yo- you shut me out!\"","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:11:55.602000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737568004409131070","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“I had too. I’m sorry.” They start crying, unable to properly articulate their thoughts, *You’ve gone and ruined it already, Astella. You fucking moron, you idiot, belligerent twat.*\n\n“I was stupid and I don’t know why I was so stupid but I was and I don’t know how not to be!”","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:14:14.440000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737568586738171954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I needed you to listen and believe in me. Believe that I love you. How are you supposed to become a knight if you are dead. It was unnecessary the creature was almost dead. You could have defended Florian instead, or protected the children. Not.... that.\" His claws move further across the wound leaving the beginnings of a bloody E shape","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:19:14.781000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737569846459629601","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"“Stop that.”","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:19:41.020000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737569956513972246","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
