{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"They walk up, calmly and unafraid in the face of his roar, “A wise Firlbog once told me to dwell in the present. We must not waste time on dreams of how the past could change. I am not in danger. If it truly does hurt you that much I will not do that again. At least, I won’t be stupid again. Rah was not your fault. I beg of you to forgive yourself. You have been an inspiring leader and wise friend to all of us. One loss has been felt around the ship, but you cannot blame yourself. This Firlbog also told me to not put yourself at the edge of the prosecuting sword when your actions or inaction are amplified within you by ego. You couldn’t have stopped the murder of Rah, and if you did, it would only be a matter of time until someone else was killed. What we can do now is move on and hope to be better in the future.”","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:35:53.292000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737574034518048788","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"(I’m rambling I guess sorry)","created_at":"2020-07-28T07:36:05.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737574084476534865","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
